      <child xsi:type="archimate:Note" id="id-b0fb68d1ca1549c3b59bb1cb0a4821e1" font="1|Noto Sans|10.0|0|GTK|1|" textAlignment="1" fillColor="#fafafa">
        <bounds x="40" y="420" width="1340" height="70"/>
        <content>A is a Colombian investor. B lives in the US (840): reg-s panics with RegSRecipientUSPerson and the whole transfer reverts, failed tx with public hash #1.
C lives in Colombia (170): same path, every check passes, successful tx with public hash #2. Both hashes are the spike evidence.</content>
      </child>
