        <bounds x="760" y="440" width="480" height="100"/>
        <content>Soft cap reached: tokens are minted to each investor (compliance runs on every mint) and the USDC goes to the vehicle treasury.
Soft cap missed: each investor calls refund() and gets the USDC back from escrow.</content>
