        <bounds x="1040" y="260" width="420" height="100"/>
        <content>New passkey, new smart account. The balance moves as TransferKind::Recovery, lock-up state moves with the investor and policy modules don&#x27;t block it. On mainnet the agent is a multisig.</content>
      </child>
